    intro: `北京安贞医院成立于1984年，是首都医科大学附属大型三甲综合医院，以心血管学科为特色的三级甲等综合性医院。医院由著名心血管病专家吴英恺院士创建，经过40年的发展，已成为集医疗、教学、科研、预防、国际交流于一体的现代化医院。医院拥有国家心血管疾病临床医学研究中心、北京市心血管疾病重点实验室、北京市心肺血管疾病研究所等国家级科研平台。安贞医院在冠心病、心脏瓣膜病、先天性心脏病、大血管疾病等领域处于国内领先地位，年完成心脏介入手术超过3万例，心脏外科手术超过8000例。医院拥有心脏内、外科国家重点学科，是国内最大的心血管专科中心之一。医院设有国际医疗部，为外籍患者提供高端心血管诊疗服务。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1984, Beijing Anzhen Hospital is a large Grade 3A comprehensive hospital affiliated with Capital Medical University, characterized by cardiovascular specialties. Founded by the renowned cardiovascular expert Academician Wu Yingkai, after 40 years of development, it has become a modern hospital integrating clinical care, education, research, prevention, and international exchange. The hospital hosts the National Clinical Research Center for Cardiovascular Diseases, the Beijing Key Laboratory of Cardiovascular Diseases, and the Beijing Institute of Heart, Lung and Blood Vessel Diseases. Anzhen leads domestically in coronary heart disease, valvular heart disease, congenital heart disease, and great vessel diseases, performing over 30,000 cardiac interventional procedures and over 8,000 cardiac surgeries annually. It has national key disciplines in both cardiology and cardiac surgery, making it one of the largest cardiovascular specialty centers in China.`,
