    intro: `北京宣武医院创建于1958年，是首都医科大学直属大型三甲综合医院，以神经科学和老年医学为特色。医院是国家神经疾病医学中心依托单位、国家老年疾病临床医学研究中心，在神经内科、神经外科、老年医学、功能神经外科等领域处于国内领先地位。宣武医院在脑血管病、帕金森病、癫痫、阿尔茨海默病等神经系统疾病的诊治方面积累了丰富经验。医院拥有中国科学院院士1人，中国工程院院士1人，国家级人才计划入选者众多。医院设有国家脑卒中筛查与防治基地、国家神经调控技术工程实验室等重要科研平台。宣武医院神经外科在功能神经外科（如脑深部电刺激DBS治疗帕金森病）方面处于国际先进水平。医院也是国家药物临床试验机构，承担了大量神经系统创新药物的研发任务。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1958, Xuanwu Hospital is a large Grade 3A comprehensive hospital directly under Capital Medical University, characterized by neuroscience and geriatrics. It hosts the National Center for Neurological Diseases and the National Clinical Research Center for Geriatric Diseases, leading domestically in neurology, neurosurgery, geriatrics, and functional neurosurgery. Xuanwu Hospital has accumulated rich experience in the diagnosis and treatment of cerebrovascular diseases, Parkinson's disease, epilepsy, and Alzheimer's disease. The hospital has 1 CAS academician, 1 CAE academician, and numerous national talent awardees. It hosts the National Stroke Screening and Prevention Base and the National Neuromodulation Technology Engineering Laboratory. The neurosurgery department has achieved internationally advanced levels in functional neurosurgery, including deep brain stimulation (DBS) for Parkinson's disease. The hospital also serves as a national drug clinical trial institution.`,
