    beds: 1245,
    departments: 36,
    image: '/images/hospital-bj.jpg',
    intro: `广安门医院（中国中医科学院广安门医院）创建于1955年，是国家中医药管理局直属的全国最大的综合性中医医院之一，也是国家中医药发展综合改革试验区重点建设单位。医院以中医肿瘤、中医内分泌、中医肛肠、中医皮肤科、中医心血管科等学科著称。医院是国家中医肿瘤临床医学研究中心依托单位，在中西医结合治疗肿瘤方面积累了丰富经验。医院设有国际医疗部，为外籍患者提供中医诊疗、针灸推拿、中药调理等特色服务。广安门医院也是世界卫生组织传统医学合作中心、国家中医临床研究基地。医院拥有国家级名老中医数十位，年门诊量超过300万人次。在中医药国际化方面，广安门医院积极推广中医药文化，接待了来自100多个国家的国际患者和医疗代表团。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1955, Guang'anmen Hospital (China Academy of Chinese Medical Sciences Guang'anmen Hospital) is one of the largest comprehensive TCM hospitals directly under the State Administration of Traditional Chinese Medicine and a key construction unit of the National TCM Development Comprehensive Reform Experimental Zone. The hospital is renowned for TCM oncology, TCM endocrinology, TCM proctology, TCM dermatology, and TCM cardiology. It hosts the National Clinical Research Center for TCM Oncology, with extensive experience in integrative treatment of cancer. The International Medical Service Division provides TCM diagnosis, acupuncture, tuina massage, and herbal medicine services for foreign patients. Guang'anmen Hospital is also a WHO Collaborating Center for Traditional Medicine and a national TCM clinical research base. With dozens of nationally renowned senior TCM physicians, annual outpatient visits exceed 3 million. The hospital actively promotes TCM culture internationally, receiving patients and medical delegations from over 100 countries.`,
