    image: '/images/hospital-bj.jpg',
    intro: `北京和睦家医院成立于1997年，是北京最早的外资综合医疗机构之一，也是中国首家通过JCI国际认证的综合私立医院。医院隶属于新风天域集团（原复星医药集团旗下），遵循美国医疗标准，提供全科医疗、妇产科、儿科、骨科、内科、外科等全方位医疗服务。和睦家医院以国际化医疗团队和多语种服务著称，拥有来自20多个国家的医生团队，提供英语、中文、日语、韩语等多语种就诊服务。医院设有产科中心，是北京外籍人士分娩的首选医院之一，提供无痛分娩、水中分娩等个性化服务。医院实行预约制就诊，每位患者的就诊时间充裕，医患沟通充分。医院还与全球主要保险公司建立了直付合作关系，方便国际患者就诊。和睦家在北京设有多个门诊部和诊所，覆盖朝阳区、顺义区、海淀区等多个区域。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1997, Beijing United Family Hospital is one of Beijing's earliest foreign-funded comprehensive medical institutions and China's first comprehensive private hospital accredited by JCI. Affiliated with New Frontier Group (formerly under Fosun Pharma), the hospital follows American medical standards, providing comprehensive services in general practice, obstetrics and gynecology, pediatrics, orthopedics, internal medicine, and surgery. United Family is renowned for its international medical team and multilingual services, with doctors from over 20 countries providing services in English, Chinese, Japanese, Korean and more. The obstetrics center is one of Beijing's top choices for expatriate deliveries, offering personalized services such as painless delivery and water birth. The hospital operates on an appointment-based system with ample consultation time and thorough doctor-patient communication. It has established direct billing partnerships with major global insurance companies. United Family operates multiple outpatient departments and clinics across Chaoyang, Shunyi, Haidian and other districts in Beijing.`,
