    departments: 56,
    image: '/images/hospital-bj.jpg',
    intro: `北京大学国际医院成立于2014年，是北京大学附属医院中规模最大的一家新建大型综合医院，位于北京市昌平区中关村生命科学园。医院占地44万平方米，总建筑面积42万平方米，是亚洲最大的单体医疗建筑之一。医院按照国际先进标准建设，拥有现代化的诊疗设施和舒适的人文环境，设有国际医疗部，为外籍患者提供多语种高端医疗服务。北大国际医院依托北京大学医学部的强大学术资源，在心血管、肿瘤、神经、骨科、妇产、儿科等领域形成了鲜明的学科特色。医院拥有PET-MR、TOMO刀、达芬奇手术机器人等国际一流设备。医院实行信息化、智能化管理，是国内首批通过电子病历系统应用水平分级评价七级的医院之一。医院致力于成为国内一流、国际知名的现代化医学中心。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 2014, Peking University International Hospital is the largest newly built comprehensive hospital among Peking University's affiliated hospitals, located in the Zhongguancun Life Science Park in Changping District, Beijing. Covering 440,000 square meters with a total floor area of 420,000 square meters, it is one of Asia's largest single-building medical facilities. Built to international advanced standards, the hospital features modern medical facilities and a comfortable humanistic environment, with an International Medical Service Division providing multilingual high-end medical services. Drawing on the strong academic resources of Peking University Health Science Center, the hospital has developed distinctive specialties in cardiology, oncology, neurology, orthopedics, obstetrics and gynecology, and pediatrics. The hospital is equipped with world-class devices including PET-MR, TOMO therapy, and Da Vinci surgical robots. It implements information-based, intelligent management and is among the first hospitals in China to achieve Level 7 in electronic medical record system application evaluation.`,
