    departments: 48,
    image: '/images/hospital-sh.jpg',
    intro: `复旦大学附属中山医院创建于1937年，是复旦大学附属最大的综合性教学医院，也是中国人创建和管理的最早的大型综合性医院之一。医院在心脏病学、肝脏病学、消化病学、呼吸病学、普通外科学等领域处于全国领先地位。中山医院是国家临床医学研究中心、国家疑难病症诊治能力提升工程建设项目单位。医院心脏外科在冠心病搭桥手术、心脏瓣膜手术、大血管手术等方面处于国际先进水平，年完成心脏手术超过7000例。肝外科在肝癌诊断和治疗方面享有国际声誉，是亚洲最大的肝肿瘤诊疗中心之一。医院拥有中国科学院院士2人，中国工程院院士2人，国家级人才计划入选者众多。年门急诊量超过400万人次，出院病人超过10万人次。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1937, Zhongshan Hospital, Fudan University is the largest comprehensive teaching hospital affiliated with Fudan University and one of the earliest large comprehensive hospitals created and managed by Chinese people. It leads nationally in cardiology, hepatology, gastroenterology, respiratory medicine, and general surgery. The hospital is a national clinical research center and a key construction unit for enhancing diagnosis and treatment capabilities for difficult diseases. The cardiac surgery department has achieved internationally advanced levels in coronary artery bypass grafting, valve surgery, and great vessel surgery, performing over 7,000 cardiac surgeries annually. The hepatobiliary surgery department enjoys international reputation in liver cancer diagnosis and treatment, being one of Asia's largest liver tumor treatment centers. The hospital has 2 CAS academicians, 2 CAE academicians, and numerous national talent awardees. Annual outpatient visits exceed 4 million, with over 100,000 discharged patients.`,
