    departments: 42,
    image: '/images/hospital-sh.jpg',
    intro: `上海交通大学医学院附属瑞金医院创建于1907年，原名广慈医院，是上海历史最悠久的综合性医院之一，也是上海交通大学医学院最大的临床教学基地。瑞金医院在血液病学、内分泌代谢病学、消化病学、烧伤科、心脏内科等领域享有盛誉。血液科是我国血液学的发源地之一，在白血病、淋巴瘤、骨髓瘤等疾病的诊治方面处于国际领先水平。内分泌科是国家代谢性疾病临床医学研究中心依托单位，在糖尿病、甲状腺疾病、肾上腺疾病等方面积累了丰富经验。医院拥有中国工程院院士3人，中国科学院院士1人，国家级人才计划入选者众多。年门急诊量超过370万人次。医院设有国际医疗部，为外籍患者提供英语、日语等多语种高端医疗服务。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1907 as Guangci Hospital, Ruijin Hospital, Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine is one of Shanghai's oldest comprehensive hospitals and the largest clinical teaching base of Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine. Ruijin Hospital is renowned in hematology, endocrinology and metabolism, gastroenterology, burn surgery, and cardiology. The hematology department is one of the birthplaces of Chinese hematology, leading internationally in the treatment of leukemia, lymphoma, and multiple myeloma. The endocrinology department hosts the National Clinical Research Center for Metabolic Diseases, with extensive experience in diabetes, thyroid disease, and adrenal disorders. The hospital has 3 CAE academicians, 1 CAS academician, and numerous national talent awardees. Annual outpatient visits exceed 3.7 million. The International Medical Service Division provides high-end medical services in English, Japanese, and other languages for foreign patients.`,
