    departments: 40,
    image: '/images/hospital-sh.jpg',
    intro: `复旦大学附属华山医院创建于1907年，前身为红十字会总医院，是复旦大学附属大型三甲综合医院。华山医院在神经科学、皮肤科、骨科、泌尿外科、康复医学等领域处于全国领先地位，是国家神经疾病医学中心依托单位之一。神经内科在脑血管病、癫痫、帕金森病、运动神经元病等神经系统疾病的诊治方面积累了丰富经验，年完成神经介入手术超过4000例。皮肤科是国家重点学科，在银屑病、白癜风、红斑狼疮等疾病的诊治方面处于国内领先水平。医院拥有中国科学院院士1人，中国工程院院士1人，国家级人才计划入选者众多。年门急诊量超过350万人次。华山医院设有国际医疗中心，为外籍患者提供高端神经科、皮肤科和骨科诊疗服务。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1907 as the former Red Cross General Hospital, Huashan Hospital, Fudan University is a large Grade 3A comprehensive hospital affiliated with Fudan University. Huashan Hospital leads nationally in neuroscience, dermatology, orthopedics, urology, and rehabilitation medicine, serving as one of the host institutions of the National Center for Neurological Diseases. The neurology department has rich experience in cerebrovascular diseases, epilepsy, Parkinson's disease, and motor neuron disease, performing over 4,000 neurointerventional procedures annually. The dermatology department is a national key discipline, leading domestically in the treatment of psoriasis, vitiligo, and lupus erythematosus. The hospital has 1 CAS academician, 1 CAE academician, and numerous national talent awardees. Annual outpatient visits exceed 3.5 million. Huashan Hospital has an International Medical Center providing high-end neurological, dermatological, and orthopedic services for foreign patients.`,
