    image: '/images/hospital-sh.jpg',
    intro: `上海交通大学医学院附属仁济医院创建于1844年，是上海开埠后第一家西医医院，也是中国历史最悠久的综合性医院之一。仁济医院在消化病学、泌尿外科学、风湿病学、妇产科学、麻醉学等领域处于全国领先地位。消化科是国家消化疾病临床医学研究中心依托单位，在炎症性肠病、胃肠动力障碍、消化道肿瘤等方面积累了丰富经验。泌尿外科在肾脏移植、前列腺疾病、泌尿系肿瘤等方面处于国内领先水平，年完成肾脏移植手术超过300例。风湿免疫科是国家重点学科，在类风湿关节炎、系统性红斑狼疮、强直性脊柱炎等方面具有显著优势。医院拥有中国工程院院士2人，国家级人才计划入选者众多。年门急诊量超过450万人次。医院设有国际医疗部，为外籍患者提供多语种高端医疗服务。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1844, Renji Hospital, Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine is the first Western medicine hospital established after Shanghai opened as a treaty port, and one of China's oldest comprehensive hospitals. Renji Hospital leads nationally in gastroenterology, urology, rheumatology, obstetrics and gynecology, and anesthesiology. The gastroenterology department hosts the National Clinical Research Center for Digestive Diseases, with extensive experience in inflammatory bowel disease, gastrointestinal motility disorders, and digestive tract tumors. The urology department leads domestically in kidney transplantation, prostate disease, and urinary tumors, performing over 300 kidney transplants annually. The rheumatology department is a national key discipline with significant advantages in rheumatoid arthritis, systemic lupus erythematosus, and ankylosing spondylitis. The hospital has 2 CAE academicians and numerous national talent awardees. Annual outpatient visits exceed 4.5 million.`,
