    intro: `复旦大学附属肿瘤医院创建于1931年，是中国最早成立肿瘤专科医院之一，也是国内规模最大、学术地位最高的肿瘤防治中心之一。医院是国家肿瘤临床医学研究中心依托单位、国家疑难病症诊治能力提升工程建设项目单位。医院在乳腺癌、肺癌、胃癌、肠癌、甲状腺癌、淋巴瘤等常见恶性肿瘤的诊治方面处于国内领先地位，年完成肿瘤手术超过3万例。医院拥有中国工程院院士2人，国家级人才计划入选者众多。放疗科拥有国内最先进的直线加速器、TOMO刀等放疗设备，年放疗人次超过4万。医院设有国际医疗部，为外籍患者提供英语、日语等多语种肿瘤诊疗服务。医院还在徐汇区和浦东区设有两个院区，形成了东西联动的诊疗格局。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1931, Fudan University Shanghai Cancer Center is one of China's earliest specialized cancer hospitals and one of the largest and most academically prestigious cancer prevention and treatment centers in the country. It hosts the National Clinical Research Center for Oncology and is a key construction unit for enhancing diagnosis and treatment of difficult diseases. The hospital leads domestically in the treatment of common cancers such as breast, lung, gastric, colorectal, thyroid, and lymphoma, performing over 30,000 cancer surgeries annually. The hospital has 2 CAE academicians and numerous national talent awardees. The radiation oncology department is equipped with the most advanced linear accelerators and TOMO therapy devices in China, treating over 40,000 patients annually. The International Medical Service Division provides tumor diagnosis and treatment services in English, Japanese, and other languages. The hospital operates two campuses in Xuhui and Pudong districts.`,
