    intro: `上海市第六人民医院创建于1904年，前身为上海公共租界工部局医院，是上海交通大学附属大型三甲综合医院。医院以骨科为特色，是国家骨科医学中心，在创伤骨科、关节外科、脊柱外科、骨肿瘤等领域处于国际领先水平。六院骨科是我国断肢再植的摇篮，1963年成功完成了世界首例断肢再植手术，开创了显微外科的新纪元。医院在人工关节置换、关节镜微创手术、脊柱畸形矫正等方面积累了丰富经验，年完成骨科手术超过5万例。医院拥有中国工程院院士1人，国家级人才计划入选者众多。年门急诊量超过350万人次。医院设有国际医疗部，为外籍患者提供骨科、内分泌科等多学科高端医疗服务。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1904 as the former Shanghai Municipal Council Hospital, Shanghai Sixth People's Hospital is a large Grade 3A comprehensive hospital affiliated with Shanghai Jiao Tong University. Characterized by orthopedics, it is the National Center for Orthopedic Medicine, leading internationally in trauma orthopedics, joint surgery, spine surgery, and bone tumors. The orthopedic department is the cradle of limb replantation in China. In 1963, it successfully completed the world's first limb replantation surgery, pioneering a new era in microsurgery. The hospital has extensive experience in joint replacement, arthroscopic minimally invasive surgery, and spinal deformity correction, performing over 50,000 orthopedic surgeries annually. The hospital has 1 academician and numerous national talent awardees. Annual outpatient visits exceed 3.5 million.`,
