    intro: `上海儿童医学中心成立于1998年，是上海交通大学医学院附属的三甲儿童专科医院，也是国家儿童医学中心依托单位之一。医院由上海市政府与世界健康基金会合作建设，按照国际先进标准设计建造。儿童医学中心在小儿先天性心脏病、小儿血液肿瘤、小儿消化系统疾病、小儿神经系统疾病、小儿骨科等领域处于国内领先地位。小儿心胸外科年完成先天性心脏病手术超过3000例，是国内最大的小儿先心病诊疗中心之一。小儿血液肿瘤科在白血病、淋巴瘤等儿童血液肿瘤的诊治方面积累了丰富经验。医院拥有国家级人才计划入选者数十人。年门急诊量超过170万人次。医院设有国际医疗部，为外籍患儿家庭提供多语种就诊服务和国际化病房。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1998, Shanghai Children's Medical Center is a Grade 3A pediatric specialized hospital affiliated with Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine and one of the host institutions of the National Center for Children's Health. It was built through cooperation between the Shanghai Municipal Government and the Project HOPE, designed to international advanced standards. The center leads domestically in pediatric congenital heart disease, pediatric hematology and oncology, pediatric digestive diseases, pediatric neurological diseases, and pediatric orthopedics. The pediatric cardiothoracic surgery department performs over 3,000 congenital heart disease surgeries annually, making it one of China's largest pediatric CHD treatment centers. The pediatric hematology and oncology department has rich experience in treating childhood leukemia and lymphoma. Annual outpatient visits exceed 1.7 million. The International Medical Service Division provides multilingual services and international wards for foreign pediatric patients and their families.`,
