    image: '/images/hospital-sh.jpg',
    intro: `上海嘉会国际医院成立于2017年，是上海首家通过JCI认证的外资综合医院，也是上海新虹桥国际医学园区的旗舰医院。医院由美国哈佛大学医学院附属麻省总医院支持建设，遵循国际医疗标准，提供全科医疗、妇产科、儿科、肿瘤科、骨科、心脏科等全方位医疗服务。嘉会医院拥有来自20多个国家的国际化医疗团队，提供英语、中文等多语种就诊服务。医院设有产科中心，提供无痛分娩、导乐分娩等个性化服务。医院还与全球多家顶级医疗机构建立了合作关系，包括麻省总医院、斯隆凯特琳癌症中心等。医院实行预约制就诊，每位患者的就诊时间充裕。嘉会医院也是上海多家跨国公司和国际学校指定的医疗服务机构。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 2017, Shanghai Jiahui International Hospital is Shanghai's first JCI-accredited foreign-funded comprehensive hospital and the flagship hospital of the Shanghai Hongqiao International Medical Park. Supported by Massachusetts General Hospital, an affiliate of Harvard Medical School, the hospital follows international medical standards, providing comprehensive services in general practice, obstetrics and gynecology, pediatrics, oncology, orthopedics, and cardiology. Jiahui Hospital has an international medical team from over 20 countries, providing services in English, Chinese, and other languages. The obstetrics center offers personalized services including painless delivery and doula-assisted delivery. The hospital has established partnerships with multiple world-class medical institutions including MGH and Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center. It operates on an appointment-based system with ample consultation time. Jiahui Hospital is also a designated healthcare provider for many multinational companies and international schools in Shanghai.`,
