    image: '/images/hospital-sh.jpg',
    intro: `上海百汇医院隶属于新加坡百汇医疗集团，是新加坡最大的私立医疗集团在中国设立的高端医疗机构。百汇医疗集团在新加坡拥有多家知名医院，包括伊丽莎白医院、鹰阁医院等。上海百汇医院提供全科医疗、妇产科、儿科、骨科、内科、外科等全方位医疗服务，遵循国际医疗标准。医院拥有来自多个国家的国际化医疗团队，提供英语、中文等多语种就诊服务。医院设有产科中心、日间手术中心等。百汇医院与全球主要保险公司建立了直付合作关系，方便国际患者就诊。医院实行预约制，注重医患沟通和个性化服务。百汇医疗集团还在中国其他城市设有诊所和医疗中心，包括上海、苏州、香港等地。`,
    introEn: `Shanghai Parkway Hospital is affiliated with Parkway Pantai Group of Singapore, the largest private healthcare group in Singapore, operating premium medical institutions in China. The Parkway Group operates several renowned hospitals in Singapore including Mount Elizabeth Hospital and Gleneagles Hospital. Shanghai Parkway Hospital provides comprehensive medical services in general practice, obstetrics and gynecology, pediatrics, orthopedics, internal medicine, and surgery, following international medical standards. The hospital has an international medical team from multiple countries, providing services in English, Chinese, and other languages. It features an obstetrics center and day surgery center. Parkway Hospital has established direct billing partnerships with major global insurance companies. It operates on an appointment-based system, emphasizing doctor-patient communication and personalized care. The Parkway Group also operates clinics and medical centers in other Chinese cities.`,
