    image: '/images/hospital-sh.jpg',
    intro: `上海长海医院创建于1949年，是海军军医大学（原第二军医大学）第一附属医院，是国家首批三级甲等综合性医院。医院在消化病学、泌尿外科、烧伤科、胸外科、神经外科等领域处于全国领先地位。长海医院消化科是国家重点学科，在胆胰疾病内镜诊疗、消化道早癌筛查等方面积累了丰富经验，年完成内镜诊疗超过5万例。泌尿外科在前列腺增生、泌尿系肿瘤、肾脏移植等方面处于国内领先水平。烧伤科是我国烧伤救治的发源地之一，在特重度烧伤救治方面具有国际先进水平。医院拥有中国工程院院士2人，国家级人才计划入选者众多。年门急诊量超过330万人次。医院设有国际医疗部，为外籍患者提供多语种高端医疗服务。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1949, Changhai Hospital is the First Affiliated Hospital of Naval Medical University (formerly Second Military Medical University) and one of China's first Grade 3A comprehensive hospitals. It leads nationally in gastroenterology, urology, burn surgery, thoracic surgery, and neurosurgery. The gastroenterology department is a national key discipline, with extensive experience in biliopancreatic endoscopic diagnosis and treatment and early gastrointestinal cancer screening, performing over 50,000 endoscopic procedures annually. The urology department leads domestically in prostate hyperplasia, urinary tumors, and kidney transplantation. The burn surgery department is one of the birthplaces of burn care in China, with internationally advanced capabilities in severe burn treatment. The hospital has 2 CAE academicians and numerous national talent awardees. Annual outpatient visits exceed 3.3 million.`,
