    intro: `中山大学附属第一医院创建于1910年，是中山大学附属规模最大、综合实力最强的三甲医院，也是中国最早的西医医院之一。医院在肾脏病、普外科、神经内科、妇产科、耳鼻喉科等领域处于全国领先地位。肾内科是国家肾脏病临床医学研究中心依托单位，在慢性肾脏病、肾衰竭、肾移植等方面积累了丰富经验，年完成肾移植手术超过500例。普外科在胃癌、结直肠癌、肝癌等消化道肿瘤的诊治方面处于国内领先水平。医院拥有中国科学院院士1人，中国工程院院士1人，国家级人才计划入选者众多。医院年门急诊量超过400万人次。医院于2014年通过JCI国际认证，是华南地区首批通过JCI认证的大型综合医院之一。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1910, The First Affiliated Hospital of Sun Yat-sen University is the largest and most comprehensively powerful Grade 3A hospital affiliated with Sun Yat-sen University and one of China's earliest Western medicine hospitals. It leads nationally in nephrology, general surgery, neurology, obstetrics and gynecology, and otorhinolaryngology. The nephrology department hosts the National Clinical Research Center for Kidney Diseases, with extensive experience in chronic kidney disease, renal failure, and kidney transplantation, performing over 500 kidney transplants annually. The general surgery department leads domestically in the diagnosis and treatment of digestive tract tumors including gastric, colorectal, and liver cancers. The hospital has 1 CAS academician, 1 CAE academician, and numerous national talent awardees. Annual outpatient visits exceed 4 million. The hospital achieved JCI accreditation in 2014, becoming one of the first large comprehensive hospitals in South China to do so.`,
