    introEn: `Founded in 1946 as the former Guangzhou Central Hospital, Guangdong Provincial People's Hospital is a large Grade 3A comprehensive hospital directly under the Guangdong Provincial Government and one of the most powerful hospitals in Guangdong Province. It leads nationally in cardiology, oncology, thoracic surgery, neurosurgery, and geriatrics. The cardiology department is the Guangdong branch of the National Clinical Research Center for Cardiovascular Diseases, with extensive experience in coronary interventional therapy, arrhythmia radiofrequency ablation, and pacemaker implantation, performing over 10,000 cardiac interventional procedures annually. The thoracic surgery department leads domestically in minimally invasive surgery for thoracic tumors such as lung and esophageal cancers. The hospital has 1 CAE academician and numerous national talent awardees. Annual outpatient visits exceed 3.6 million.`,
