    intro: `中山大学肿瘤防治中心（中山大学附属肿瘤医院、中山大学肿瘤研究所）成立于1964年，是中山大学直属的国家级肿瘤防治研究机构，也是华南地区规模最大、学术地位最高的肿瘤专科医院。中心在鼻咽癌、肝癌、食管癌、淋巴瘤、妇科肿瘤等领域的诊治水平处于国际领先地位。鼻咽癌诊治是中心的传统优势项目，年收治鼻咽癌患者超过3000例，是世界上最大的鼻咽癌诊疗中心。中心拥有国家重点学科肿瘤学，设有华南肿瘤学国家重点实验室、国家新药（抗肿瘤药物）临床试验研究中心等国家级科研平台。中心拥有中国工程院院士1人，中国科学院院士1人，国家级人才计划入选者众多。年门诊量超过80万人次。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1964, Sun Yat-sen University Cancer Center (affiliated with Sun Yat-sen University Cancer Hospital and Cancer Research Institute) is a national cancer prevention and treatment research institution directly under Sun Yat-sen University and the largest and most academically prestigious cancer-specialized hospital in South China. The center leads internationally in the treatment of nasopharyngeal carcinoma, liver cancer, esophageal cancer, lymphoma, and gynecologic cancers. NPC diagnosis and treatment is the center's traditional strength, treating over 3,000 NPC patients annually, making it the world's largest NPC treatment center. The center has the national key discipline of oncology, hosting the State Key Laboratory of Oncology in South China and the National New Drug (Anticancer) Clinical Trial Research Center. The center has 1 CAE academician, 1 CAS academician, and numerous national talent awardees. Annual outpatient visits exceed 800,000.`,
