    image: '/images/hospital-gz.jpg',
    intro: `复星禅诚医院隶属于复星医药集团，是一家以国际医疗为特色的现代化私立综合医院，位于广州市核心区域。医院依托复星医药集团的全球化医疗网络，与美国、以色列、德国等多个国家的顶级医疗机构建立了合作关系。医院设有国际医疗部，为外籍患者和高端人群提供全科医疗、妇产科、儿科、骨科、内科、外科等全方位医疗服务。医院实行预约制就诊，注重医患沟通和个性化服务。医院配备了先进的诊疗设备，包括MRI、CT、四维彩超等。复星医药集团在全球拥有多家知名医疗机构，包括以色列的Ahava、印度的Gland Pharma等，禅诚医院充分整合了这些国际医疗资源，为在华外籍人士提供优质医疗服务。`,
    introEn: `Fosun ChanCheng Hospital is affiliated with Fosun Pharma Group, a modern private comprehensive hospital characterized by international medical services, located in the core area of Guangzhou. Drawing on Fosun Pharma's global healthcare network, the hospital has established partnerships with top medical institutions in the United States, Israel, Germany, and other countries. The International Medical Service Division provides comprehensive services in general practice, obstetrics and gynecology, pediatrics, orthopedics, internal medicine, and surgery for foreign patients and high-end clientele. The hospital operates on an appointment-based system, emphasizing doctor-patient communication and personalized care. It is equipped with advanced diagnostic equipment including MRI, CT, and 4D ultrasound. Fosun Pharma operates multiple renowned medical institutions globally, and ChanCheng Hospital integrates these international medical resources to provide quality healthcare for expatriates in China.`,
