    intro: `深圳市人民医院创建于1946年，前身是宝安县人民医院，是深圳市历史最悠久、规模最大的综合性三甲医院，也是深圳市政府直属医院。医院在心血管病学、神经病学、消化病学、骨科、泌尿外科等领域处于全市领先地位，是深圳市多个医学专科的医疗质量控制中心依托单位。心血管内科在冠心病介入治疗、心律失常射频消融等方面积累了丰富经验。神经内科在脑血管病、癫痫、帕金森病等方面具有显著优势。医院拥有国家级人才计划入选者数十人。医院设有留医部、龙华分院、坂田院区等多个院区，年门急诊量超过400万人次。医院设有国际医疗部，为在深外籍患者提供多语种高端医疗服务。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1946 as the former Bao'an County People's Hospital, Shenzhen People's Hospital is Shenzhen's oldest and largest comprehensive Grade 3A hospital and a hospital directly under the Shenzhen Municipal Government. It leads citywide in cardiology, neurology, gastroenterology, orthopedics, and urology, serving as the host institution for multiple municipal medical specialty quality control centers. The cardiology department has extensive experience in coronary interventional therapy and arrhythmia radiofrequency ablation. The neurology department has significant advantages in cerebrovascular diseases, epilepsy, and Parkinson's disease. The hospital has dozens of national talent awardees. It operates multiple campuses including Liuyi Campus, Longhua Branch, and Bantian Campus. Annual outpatient visits exceed 4 million.`,
