    image: '/images/hospital-sz.jpg',
    intro: `北京大学深圳医院创建于1999年，是深圳市政府与北京大学合作共建的大型三甲综合医院，也是北京大学在深圳的临床教学基地。医院在泌尿外科、妇产科、骨科、内分泌科、消化科等领域处于全市领先地位。泌尿外科在肾脏移植、前列腺疾病、泌尿系肿瘤等方面积累了丰富经验，年完成肾移植手术超过200例。妇产科在产前诊断、高危妊娠管理、妇科肿瘤等方面具有显著优势。医院拥有国家级人才计划入选者数十人。医院年门急诊量超过300万人次。医院于2013年通过JCI国际认证，是深圳市首批通过JCI认证的三甲医院之一。医院设有国际医疗部，为外籍患者提供多语种高端医疗服务。医院与北京大学医学部保持紧密的学术联系，是深圳市重要的医学人才培养基地。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1999 as a collaborative project between the Shenzhen Municipal Government and Peking University, Peking University Shenzhen Hospital is a large Grade 3A comprehensive hospital and Peking University's clinical teaching base in Shenzhen. It leads citywide in urology, obstetrics and gynecology, orthopedics, endocrinology, and gastroenterology. The urology department has extensive experience in kidney transplantation, prostate disease, and urinary tumors, performing over 200 kidney transplants annually. The obstetrics and gynecology department has significant advantages in prenatal diagnosis, high-risk pregnancy management, and gynecologic oncology. The hospital has dozens of national talent awardees. Annual outpatient visits exceed 3 million. The hospital achieved JCI accreditation in 2013, becoming one of Shenzhen's first Grade 3A hospitals with JCI accreditation.`,
