    departments: 20,
    image: '/images/hospital-sz.jpg',
    intro: `中国医学科学院阜外医院深圳医院成立于2018年，是国家心血管病中心深圳分中心，由北京阜外医院全面托管运营，是深圳市心血管专科领域的标杆医院。医院依托阜外医院在心血管领域的国家级优势资源，在冠心病、心脏瓣膜病、先天性心脏病、心律失常、心力衰竭等方面提供高水平的诊疗服务。医院设有心脏外科、心血管内科、心律失常中心、心力衰竭中心、高血压中心等多个心血管专科中心，年完成心脏手术超过3000例。医院拥有来自阜外医院的顶尖专家团队常驻深圳，包括多名国家杰出青年科学基金获得者。医院的目标是将北京阜外医院的世界级心血管诊疗技术引入深圳，服务粤港澳大湾区的心血管疾病患者。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 2018, Fuwai Hospital Shenzhen, CAMS is the Shenzhen branch of the National Center for Cardiovascular Diseases, fully managed and operated by Beijing Fuwai Hospital, serving as a benchmark cardiovascular hospital in Shenzhen. Drawing on Beijing Fuwai's national-level advantages in cardiovascular medicine, the hospital provides high-level diagnosis and treatment services for coronary heart disease, valvular heart disease, congenital heart disease, arrhythmia, and heart failure. It features multiple cardiovascular specialty centers including cardiac surgery, cardiology, arrhythmia center, heart failure center, and hypertension center, performing over 3,000 cardiac surgeries annually. The hospital has top expert teams from Beijing Fuwai stationed in Shenzhen, including multiple National Science Fund for Distinguished Young Scholars awardees. The hospital's goal is to bring Beijing Fuwai's world-class cardiovascular technology to Shenzhen to serve patients in the Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area.`,
