    intro: `香港大学深圳医院成立于2012年，是深圳市政府与香港大学合作共建的大型三甲综合医院，也是港大医学院在内地的首家直属附属医院。医院引入香港国际化的医疗管理模式，实行全预约制、团队诊疗、透明收费等创新机制。医院在骨科、妇产科、儿科、肿瘤科、器官移植等领域形成了鲜明特色。骨科在关节置换、脊柱手术、运动医学等方面积累了丰富经验。妇产科在产前诊断、高危妊娠管理等方面具有显著优势。器官移植中心是深圳市唯一具有肾脏移植、肝脏移植、心脏移植资质的医疗机构。医院拥有来自香港和内地的国际化医疗团队，提供英语、粤语、普通话等多语种服务。医院年门急诊量超过200万人次，是深圳市民和外籍人士信赖的医疗机构之一。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 2012 as a collaborative project between the Shenzhen Municipal Government and The University of Hong Kong, HKU-Shenzhen Hospital is a large Grade 3A comprehensive hospital and HKU's first directly affiliated hospital in mainland China. The hospital introduces Hong Kong's international medical management model, implementing innovative mechanisms such as full appointment-based system, team-based care, and transparent pricing. It has developed distinctive specialties in orthopedics, obstetrics and gynecology, pediatrics, oncology, and organ transplantation. The orthopedics department has extensive experience in joint replacement, spine surgery, and sports medicine. The organ transplant center is the only medical institution in Shenzhen qualified for kidney, liver, and heart transplantation. The hospital has an international medical team from Hong Kong and mainland China, providing services in English, Cantonese, and Mandarin. Annual outpatient visits exceed 2 million.`,
