    image: '/images/hospital-sz.jpg',
    intro: `深圳大学总医院成立于2018年，是深圳大学直属的综合性三甲医院，位于深圳市南山区，是深圳市南山区的重点医疗建设项目。医院依托深圳大学的科研和人才优势，在神经科学、骨科、消化科、心血管科、肿瘤科等领域形成了鲜明的学科特色。国际医疗部为外籍患者和高端人群提供多语种高端医疗服务，包括英语、日语、韩语等。医院拥有现代化的诊疗设施和舒适的就医环境，配备了MRI、CT、达芬奇手术机器人等国际一流设备。医院神经外科在脑肿瘤、脑血管病、功能神经外科等方面积累了丰富经验。骨科在关节置换、脊柱手术、运动医学等方面处于全市先进水平。医院年门急诊量超过150万人次，是深圳市医学人才培养和科学研究的重要基地。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 2018, Shenzhen University General Hospital is a Grade 3A comprehensive hospital directly under Shenzhen University, located in Nanshan District, Shenzhen, and a key healthcare construction project in the district. Drawing on Shenzhen University's research and talent advantages, the hospital has developed distinctive specialties in neuroscience, orthopedics, gastroenterology, cardiology, and oncology. The International Medical Department provides high-end multilingual medical services for foreign patients and high-end clientele, including English, Japanese, and Korean. The hospital features modern medical facilities and a comfortable environment, equipped with MRI, CT, Da Vinci surgical robots, and other world-class equipment. The neurosurgery department has extensive experience in brain tumors, cerebrovascular diseases, and functional neurosurgery. Annual outpatient visits exceed 1.5 million.`,
