    image: '/images/hospital-sz.jpg',
    intro: `深圳市第三人民医院创建于1985年，前身为深圳市东湖医院，是深圳市属大型三甲综合医院，也是深圳市唯一的传染病专科医院。医院在传染病防治、器官移植、肝胆外科、消化内科等领域处于全市领先地位。医院是深圳市传染病定点救治医院，在应对突发公共卫生事件中发挥了重要作用，是深圳市抗击新冠疫情的核心医院之一。器官移植中心是深圳市唯一具有肝脏移植、肾脏移植资质的医疗机构，年完成器官移植手术超过200例。肝胆外科在肝癌、胆道疾病、胰腺疾病等方面积累了丰富经验。医院拥有国家级人才计划入选者数十人。医院设有国际医疗部，为外籍患者提供多语种高端医疗服务。医院年门急诊量超过200万人次。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1985 as the former Shenzhen Donghu Hospital, Shenzhen Third People's Hospital is a large municipal Grade 3A comprehensive hospital and Shenzhen's only specialized infectious disease hospital. It leads citywide in infectious disease prevention and treatment, organ transplantation, hepatobiliary surgery, and gastroenterology. The hospital is Shenzhen's designated infectious disease treatment hospital and played a crucial role in responding to public health emergencies, serving as one of the core hospitals in Shenzhen's fight against COVID-19. The organ transplant center is the only medical institution in Shenzhen qualified for liver and kidney transplantation, performing over 200 organ transplants annually. The hepatobiliary surgery department has extensive experience in liver cancer, biliary diseases, and pancreatic diseases. Annual outpatient visits exceed 2 million.`,
