    image: '/images/hospital-sz.jpg',
    intro: `深圳市儿童医院创建于1998年，是深圳市唯一的三甲儿童专科医院，也是国家儿童医学中心（深圳）依托单位。医院在小儿先天性心脏病、小儿血液肿瘤、小儿神经系统疾病、小儿消化系统疾病、新生儿疾病等领域处于全市领先地位。小儿心胸外科年完成先天性心脏病手术超过1500例，是华南地区最大的小儿先心病诊疗中心之一。小儿血液肿瘤科在白血病、淋巴瘤等儿童血液肿瘤的诊治方面积累了丰富经验。新生儿科是深圳市新生儿急救中心，配备了先进的新生儿重症监护设备。医院拥有国家级人才计划入选者数十人。医院设有国际医疗部，为在深外籍患儿家庭提供多语种就诊服务和国际化病房。年门急诊量超过180万人次。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 1998, Shenzhen Children's Hospital is Shenzhen's only Grade 3A pediatric specialized hospital and the host institution of the National Center for Children's Health (Shenzhen). It leads citywide in pediatric congenital heart disease, pediatric hematology and oncology, pediatric neurological diseases, pediatric digestive diseases, and neonatal diseases. The pediatric cardiothoracic surgery department performs over 1,500 congenital heart disease surgeries annually, making it one of the largest pediatric CHD treatment centers in South China. The pediatric hematology and oncology department has extensive experience in treating childhood leukemia and lymphoma. The neonatology department is Shenzhen's neonatal emergency center, equipped with advanced neonatal intensive care equipment. Annual outpatient visits exceed 1.8 million.`,
