    image: '/images/hospital-sz.jpg',
    intro: `深圳和睦家医院成立于2019年，是北京和睦家医疗集团在深圳设立的综合性私立医院，遵循美国医疗标准，是深圳首批通过JCI国际认证的私立医院之一。医院提供全科医疗、妇产科、儿科、骨科、内科、外科等全方位医疗服务。和睦家医院以国际化医疗团队和多语种服务著称，拥有来自多个国家的医生团队，提供英语、中文等多语种就诊服务。医院设有产科中心，是深圳外籍人士分娩的首选医院之一，提供无痛分娩、水中分娩等个性化服务。医院实行预约制就诊，每位患者的就诊时间充裕，医患沟通充分。医院与全球主要保险公司建立了直付合作关系，方便国际患者就诊。深圳和睦家还设有多个门诊部，覆盖福田区、南山区等多个区域。`,
    introEn: `Founded in 2019, Shenzhen United Family Hospital is a comprehensive private hospital established by Beijing United Family Healthcare Group in Shenzhen, following American medical standards and one of Shenzhen's first private hospitals with JCI international accreditation. It provides comprehensive services in general practice, obstetrics and gynecology, pediatrics, orthopedics, internal medicine, and surgery. United Family is renowned for its international medical team and multilingual services, with doctors from multiple countries providing services in English, Chinese, and other languages. The obstetrics center is one of Shenzhen's top choices for expatriate deliveries, offering personalized services such as painless delivery and water birth. The hospital operates on an appointment-based system with ample consultation time and thorough doctor-patient communication. It has established direct billing partnerships with major global insurance companies. Shenzhen United Family also operates multiple outpatient clinics across Futian, Nanshan, and other districts.`,
