    image: '/images/hospital-boao.jpg',
    intro: `瑞金海南医院（上海交通大学医学院附属瑞金医院海南医院）是2021年由上海瑞金医院在海南博鳌乐城国际医疗旅游先行区设立的分院，是博鳌乐城先行区引入的首批国内顶级公立医院之一。医院依托瑞金医院在血液病学、内分泌代谢病学、消化病学、烧伤科等领域的国家级优势，为国内外患者提供高水平的医疗服务。作为乐城先行区的特许药械政策受益单位，瑞金海南医院可以使用国内尚未上市的国际先进药物和医疗器械，为疑难重症患者提供更多治疗选择。医院设有血液病诊疗中心、内分泌代谢中心、消化内镜中心等重点专科，配备了国际一流的诊疗设备。瑞金海南医院的设立标志着上海优质医疗资源向海南辐射，对推动海南自贸港建设和国际医疗旅游发展具有重要意义。`,
    introEn: `Ruijin Hospital Hainan Branch (Ruijin Hospital Hainan Branch, Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine) was established in 2021 by Shanghai Ruijin Hospital in the Boao Lecheng International Medical Tourism Pilot Zone, Hainan. It is one of the first top-tier public hospitals introduced into the Lecheng Pilot Zone. Drawing on Ruijin Hospital's national-level advantages in hematology, endocrinology and metabolism, gastroenterology, and burn surgery, the branch provides high-level medical services for domestic and international patients. As a beneficiary of Lecheng's special drug and device policies, Ruijin Hainan can use internationally advanced drugs and medical devices not yet approved in mainland China, offering more treatment options for patients with difficult diseases. The hospital features key specialty centers including hematology, endocrinology and metabolism, and digestive endoscopy, equipped with world-class medical equipment.`,
