    image: '/images/hospital-boao.jpg',
    intro: `四川大学华西乐城医院是四川大学华西医院在海南博鳌乐城国际医疗旅游先行区设立的分院，于2022年正式投入运营。华西医院是中国西部最强、全国排名前列的顶级综合医院，其在重症医学、泌尿外科、神经外科、骨科、呼吸科等领域的实力全国闻名。华西乐城医院依托华西医院的强大学科优势和专家团队，为国内外患者提供高水平的医疗服务。作为乐城先行区的重要组成部分，华西乐城医院可以利用特许药械政策，引进和使用国内尚未上市的国际先进药物和医疗器械。医院设有重症医学中心、泌尿外科中心、神经外科中心等重点专科，配备了国际一流的诊疗设备。华西乐城医院的设立是四川大学服务国家战略、参与海南自贸港建设的重要举措。`,
    introEn: `West China Hospital Boao Branch is a branch of Sichuan University West China Hospital established in the Boao Lecheng International Medical Tourism Pilot Zone, Hainan, officially operational in 2022. West China Hospital is the strongest hospital in Western China and ranks among the top comprehensive hospitals nationally, renowned for its strength in critical care medicine, urology, neurosurgery, orthopedics, and respiratory medicine. The Boao Branch draws on West China Hospital's powerful disciplinary advantages and expert teams to provide high-level medical services for domestic and international patients. As an important component of the Lecheng Pilot Zone, West China Boao can utilize special drug and device policies to import and use internationally advanced drugs and medical devices not yet available in mainland China. The hospital features key specialty centers including critical care, urology, and neurosurgery, equipped with world-class medical equipment.`,
