    image: '/images/hospital-boao.jpg',
    intro: `博鳌超级医院（博鳌恒大国际医院的前身之一，现为独立运营实体）成立于2018年，是海南博鳌乐城国际医疗旅游先行区的标志性医疗机构。超级医院采用"1+N"模式运营，即一个共享医院平台加多个院士、专家工作站。医院充分利用乐城先行区的特许药械政策，率先引进和使用国内尚未上市的全球最新药品和医疗器械。医院设有李兰娟院士工作站、郑树森院士工作站、王辰院士工作站等多个院士工作站，涵盖肝胆胰外科、感染病学、呼吸病学等多个领域。超级医院已成功引进了全球首款磁悬浮人工心脏、全球最新款人工耳蜗、全球最新款可降解支架等多项国际先进医疗技术。医院为国内外患者提供了在国内享受国际前沿医疗技术服务的机会。`,
    introEn: `Boao Super Hospital, established in 2018, is an iconic medical institution in the Boao Lecheng International Medical Tourism Pilot Zone, Hainan. The hospital operates on a "1+N" model, featuring one shared hospital platform plus multiple academicians' and experts' workstations. It fully utilizes Lecheng's special drug and device policies to be the first to introduce and use the world's latest drugs and medical devices not yet approved in mainland China. The hospital hosts workstations of Academician Li Lanjuan (infectious diseases), Academician Zheng Shusen (hepatobiliary and pancreatic surgery), Academician Wang Chen (respiratory medicine), and others. Boao Super Hospital has successfully introduced the world's first magnetically levitated artificial heart, the latest cochlear implant, and the latest biodegradable stent. The hospital provides domestic and international patients with access to cutting-edge international medical technology within China.`,
