    introEn: `Founded in 2015, Hainan Provincial Cancer Hospital is Hainan's only provincial cancer-specialized hospital and an important base for cancer prevention and treatment in the province. Located in Haikou City, it is an important component of the Hainan Free Trade Port construction. The hospital has extensive experience in treating common cancers such as lung, breast, gastric, colorectal, and liver cancers, treating over 20,000 cancer patients annually. It is equipped with world-class radiation therapy equipment including PET-CT, linear accelerators, and TOMO therapy, treating over 10,000 radiation patients annually. The International Medical Service Division provides multilingual services for foreign patients and cancer patients visiting Hainan. As the leading hospital in Hainan's cancer prevention and treatment system, the hospital leads the province in cancer screening, standardized treatment, and multidisciplinary comprehensive treatment.`,
